{
  "_comment": "CR-018 (AWS-A2): one entry per app. 'secrets' are the keys of the app's Secrets Manager JSON secret, injected as environment variables; 'from' maps each key to the variable name in the pilot settings file (sync-secrets.mjs). 'env' values are plain configuration; ${domain}, ${tenant_id}, ${supabase_url}, ${storage_url} are filled by Terraform. Service-to-service URLs use ECS Service Connect names.",
